  "prompt": "# Core Summary\nFour anthropomorphized cats engage in a high-stakes Mahjong game around a green felt table, blending realistic feline features with human-like concentration. The clip uses a multi-shot progression (6 shots total) to establish the setting, rapidly cycle through each player's intense \"thinking face,\" and climax with the orange cat declaring a win. The visual style is photorealistic with cinematic lighting, emphasizing fur texture and tile details.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:01] Indoor Mahjong room, warm ambient lighting with a slight haze. Center frame is a square green felt Mahjong table with wooden tiles stacked in walls. Background is softly blurred, suggesting a cozy, traditional room with wooden furniture.\n[shot2][00:01-00:01.5] Extreme close-up environment fragment: Green felt texture and blurred wooden tiles in foreground. Lighting is focused on the center, creating a spotlight effect.\n[shot3][00:01.5-00:02] Environment identical to [shot2].\n[shot4][00:02-00:02.5] Environment identical to [shot2].\n[shot5][00:02.5-00:03] Environment identical to [shot2].\n[shot6][00:03-00:05] Environment identical to [shot2], but with the orange cat's paw and tile sharply in focus in the foreground.\n**Audio Description**: Background sound of Mahjong tiles clacking softly. A rhythmic, tense drum beat starts low and builds. At the end, a sharp, traditional Chinese gong or cymbal crash syncs with the text appearance.\n\n# Subjects Description\n-   **<ID_A> (Black Cat)**: Male. Domestic shorthair, sleek black fur, bright yellow eyes. Wearing a small traditional red collar. Vocal Characteristics: None.\n-   **<ID_B> (White Cat)**: Female. Fluffy white fur, blue eyes. Wearing a small blue collar. Vocal Characteristics: None.\n-   **<ID_C> (Calico Cat)**: Female. Tri-color fur (white, black, orange patches), green eyes. Wearing a small green collar. Vocal Characteristics: None.\n-   **<ID_D> (Orange Cat)**: Male. Large orange tabby, striped fur, intense amber eyes. Wearing a gold bell collar. Vocal Characteristics: None.\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:01] Wide shot, Dolly In. Four cats <ID_A>, <ID_B>, <ID_C>, <ID_D> sit upright around the square Mahjong table, one at each side. <ID_A> is left, <ID_B> is back, <ID_C> is right, <ID_D> is front. They stare intently at the tiles. The camera pushes in slowly, establishing the \"game start\" tension. Sound of tiles shuffling fades into silence.\n\n[shot2][00:01-00:01.5] Cut-in, Extreme Close-Up. <ID_A> (Black Cat) is center frame, head lowered slightly, eyes narrowed at the tiles in front. One black paw rests near a tile. The cat blinks slowly, showing deep concentration. Quick sound of a single tile being touched.\n\n[shot3][00:01.5-00:02] Cutaway, Extreme Close-Up. <ID_B> (White Cat) is center frame, head tilted, ears perked up. White paws are tucked close to the chest, eyes wide and scanning the table. The fur texture is highly detailed under the warm light. Sound of a soft meow-like breath.\n\n[shot4][00:02-00:02.5] Cutaway, Extreme Close-Up. <ID_C> (Calico Cat) is center frame, licking lips slightly, eyes darting left and right. One paw hovers over a tile, undecided. The tension is visible in the stiff posture. Sound of a quick inhale.\n\n[shot5][00:02.5-00:03] Cutaway, Extreme Close-Up. <ID_D> (Orange Cat) is center frame. Eyes widen suddenly, pupils dilate. The head lifts confidently. The right paw tenses, preparing to move. A subtle musical rise indicates a realization.\n\n[shot6][00:03-00:05] Cut-in, Medium Close-Up. <ID_D> (Orange Cat) slams a tile down onto the table with its right paw. The motion is decisive and forceful. As the paw hits the tile, the text `\"胡了！\"` appears in bold red Chinese characters with a gold outline in the center of the screen. The cat holds the pose, looking triumphant. A loud, resonant gong sound strikes exactly when the text appears.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\nPhotorealistic CGI or high-end macro photography style. Color palette is warm and rich: emerald green table, natural wood tones, and vibrant cat fur colors. Lighting is dramatic and directional (chiaroscuro), highlighting the eyes and paws while keeping the background in soft shadow. High contrast, sharp focus on subjects, shallow depth of field for close-ups.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\nHumorous yet intense. The juxtaposition of cute cats with the serious atmosphere of a gambling game creates a \"contrast cuteness.\" The mood shifts from quiet tension to triumphant excitement at the end.",
